# Never commit recordings or identifiable study artifacts.  The two explicit
# exceptions below are public, non-study demo/reference material described in
# their directory READMEs.
**/RecordedData_Raw/
**/RecordedData_Raw.zip
**/IMPACTData/*.csv
**/IMPACTData/*.json
**/IMPACTData/*.txt
unity_project/Assets/RecordedData/*
!unity_project/Assets/RecordedData/Sample/
!unity_project/Assets/RecordedData/Sample/**
!unity_project/Assets/RecordedData/ExpertMVC/
!unity_project/Assets/RecordedData/ExpertMVC/**

